@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Read tutor lesson details
actor Tutor
participant "Tutor lesson API" as Api
participant "GetTutorLessonHandler" as Handler
database "SQL Server" as Db

Tutor -> Api: GET /api/tutors/me/lessons/{lessonId}
Api -> Handler: Query with tutor account and lesson ID
Handler -> Db: Read tutor-owned lesson, agreement, student and note
Db --> Handler: Lesson or no match
alt Missing or foreign lesson
  Handler --> Api: Lessons.LessonNotFound
  Api --> Tutor: 404 Not Found
else Lesson found
  Handler -> Handler: Calculate estimate for a scheduled lesson with a rate
  Handler --> Api: Lesson and optional note
  Api --> Tutor: 200 OK
end
@enduml
